{"id":"steam-1194130","steam":1194130,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Paradise Away","summary":"Manage a group of survivals in this base building game set in a tropical island! Will you be able to escape from the island?","about":"About Paradise Away\n\r\nParadise Away is a survival base building game, take control over multiple characters, get their trust  and follow the story!\r\n\r\n\nWhat would you do if you end up in a desert island with a group of strangers?\n\r\nManage the group of strangers, get their trust and survive the enemies of the island!\r\n\r\n\nManage the relation with each strangers\n\r\nEach character is different from the other, will you be able to satisfy each request and get a long term relation with each one of them?\r\n\r\n\nEscape!\n\r\nBuild and research new technologies in order to escape from the island!\r\n\r\n\nRule the Island!\n\r\nChoose the best law to issue in order to keep the trust of your crew!\r\n\r\n\nFeatures:\n\r\n\n\r\n• Build your Base in the middle of the ocean.\r\n• Assign the characters that trust you to different jobs.\r\n• Fight animals and other night creatures!\r\n• Research new abilities and buildings.\r\n• Issue the community rules.\r\n• Escape from the islands.\r\n• Meet the strangers that are living this experience with you!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194130/library_600x900.jpg?t=1699031157","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194130/header.jpg?t=1699031157","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194130/library_hero.jpg?t=1699031157","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194130/header.jpg?t=1699031157","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194130/ss_7dda3d63d20803ef66143c419daceb755d4112ba.600x338.jpg?t=1699031157","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s